blocks.en:
Someone frowns while attempting a task and says, Let me finish explaining before you help .
G identifies the actor and speaker; W interprets the supported state;
N identifies support needs; T favors listening before intervening.

blocks.zh:
有人在尝试任务时皱眉说 在你帮忙之前让我解释清楚
G 表示演员和扬声器;W 解释支持状态;
N确定支助需求;T优先在发言前倾听。

blocks.en:
For an offered object, identifying the giver and recipient targets G;
choosing an acknowledgment targets S; deciding whether to accept or
step back targets A. Response choices also depend on requests and refusals.

